{
  "slug": "promptguard",
  "name": "Promptguard",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "LLM security for AI coding agents. Protect applications from prompt injection, PII leakage, and data exfiltration. Provides MCP tools for scanning text, redacting PII, and reviewing code for LLM security vulnerabilities. Includes an agent skill for secure LLM integration patterns and a complete API reference skill for PromptGuard's scan, redact, and guard endpoints.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, **1 agent**, **2 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `promptguard-api` (Generate correct PromptGuard API calls for scanning, redacting, and guarding LLM traffic), `secure-llm-integration` (Add PromptGuard security to any LLM-powered application)\n- **Agents** (1): `llm-security-reviewer` (Security-focused code reviewer specialized in LLM application threats -- prompt injection, PII leakage, data exfiltration, and agent tool…)\n- **Commands** (2): `promptguard-scan` (Scan the project for unprotected LLM SDK usage, hardcoded secrets, and missing security configurations), `promptguard-secure` (Add PromptGuard security to the current project)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `promptguard`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install promptguard@claude-community` from `acebot712/promptguard-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 2,
    "agent": 1,
    "command": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
